  "notes": [
    "Breaker and ward locations now use a saved randomized rotation on Easy, Normal, Hard and Nightmare. Each objective uses all eight of its possible sites before repeating; all 24 sites participate in an eight-run cycle.",
    "Consecutive runs avoid the same objective site even at cycle boundaries. Each level and difficulty keeps its own rotation, which survives restarting the game.",
    "Solo new games, restarts and co-op host starts use the rotation. Peers reproduce the host plan from its shared seed; reachability, objective spacing and map discovery rules remain intact.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Existing settings and quieter player footsteps are preserved."
  ],
